IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q06-BATCH-OVERFLOW.
*> Sums N amounts into PIC 9(6) (max 999999).
*> Tests: exact max 999999 (ok), 1000000 (TOTAL OVERFLOW).

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-COUNT            PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-IDX              PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-AMT              PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
01  WS-TOTAL            PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
01  WS-OVERFLOW-FLAG    PIC X(1) VALUE "N".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-COUNT

    PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-COUNT OR WS-OVERFLOW-FLAG = "Y"
        ACCEPT WS-AMT
        ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOTAL
            ON SIZE ERROR
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-OVERFLOW-FLAG
        END-ADD
    END-PERFORM

    IF WS-OVERFLOW-FLAG = "Y"
        DISPLAY "TOTAL OVERFLOW"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY WS-TOTAL
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
